### Login (παίρνει token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@test.gr",
  "password": "ΤΟ_PASSWORD_ΤΟΥ"
}

### (Εναλλακτικά) Register νέο customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.gr",
  "password": "test1234",
  "fullName": "Test Customer",
  "phone": "6900000000"
}

### Book appointment (χρειάζεται token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ΒΑΛΕ_ΤΟ_TOKEN_ΕΔΩ

{
  "serviceIds": [1],
  "employeeId": 3,
  "startsAt": "2026-08-10T06:00:00Z"
}